    "description": "The FOT can specify building lines to safeguard existing or future railway installations and systems. No constructional changes or other measures that contradict the purpose of the building line may be implemented between building lines or between a building line and a railway system. The FOT has not yet made use of this tool. As a result, no content and no minimal geodata model are available for this data set. The metadata set serves solely as a description of the Feature Service for the corresponding level in the cantonal PLR-cadastre.",
